# FinPulse Environment Variables
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Zero-Config Mode:
# The application runs out of the box with zero external configuration!
# If VITE_SUPABASE_URL and VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY are not provided, FinPulse
# seamlessly uses its local persistent storage engine with 1-click Demo Mode.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional: Supabase Integration
# Replace with your Supabase Project URL and Public Anon Key from project settings:
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
